		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Triple-headed, black-furred gnoll with greasy, mutable flesh. Horseman of Famine, ate the prior horseman.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 78, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +8 (1d10 + swallow), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Swallow</strong>. On a bite attack roll of 19-20, target is swallowed regardless of size. Total darkness inside and 2d10 damage per round, die and soul consumed at 0 HP. Horseman regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 20 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
